--- !u!114 &1671922013
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1671922005}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 14185ccc3590b204caf488f2057b2939, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  languageData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: eb0c907e1bf9b3e4b9c51bdece2e7eb6, type: 2}
  textTMP: {fileID: 1953377528}
  textTMP_shadow: {fileID: 1317844250}
  englishSubtitles:
  - Slowly...
  - Slowly, they emerge.
  - Coming through small fissures in the fabric of reality.
  - Escaped from hell
  - In small quantities, they are responsible for human malevolence
  - However
  - 'When they come out in large numbers '
  - they threaten the stability of all life on Earth.
  - 'When this happens, the sacred exorcists are summoned '
  - 'Ancient creatures who protect humanity from demons '
  - and are the only ones capable of stopping the forces of hell.
  - A long period of peace made demons nothing more than a memory,
  - 'And after ages '
  - 'The memory turned into legend '
  - 'And the fear humans once felt from demons was forgotten '
  - Peace made their existence purposeless, and many withered
  - The flame of life extinguished within them
  - But not for Azaus
  - He always knew that hell never rests
  - and the greater the silence, the larger the storm that followed it
  - His quest led him to an ancient cemetery,
  - where something unimaginable awaited him
  portugueseSubtitles:
  - Aos poucos...
  - 'Aos poucos eles surgem '
  - Passando por pequenas fissuras no tecido da realidade.
  - Fugidos do inferno.
  - "Em pequenas quantidades, s\xE3o respons\xE1veis pela malevol\xEAncia humana."
  - No entanto
  - "quando saem em grande n\xFAmero"
  - "amea\xE7am a estabilidade de toda a vida na Terra."
  - "Quando isso acontece, os exorcistas sagrados s\xE3o convocados."
  - "Criaturas antigas que protegem a humanidade dos dem\xF4nios"
  - "e s\xE3o os \xFAnicos capazes de deter as for\xE7as do inferno."
  - "Um longo per\xEDodo de paz fez dos dem\xF4nios nada mais do que uma lembran\xE7a."
  - E depois de eras
  - "a lembran\xE7a virou lenda."
  - "e o medo que os humanos sentiam dos dem\xF4nios foi esquecido."
  - "A paz tornou a exist\xEAncia deles sem prop\xF3sito, e muitos definharam"
  - A chama da vida se extinguiu dentro deles.
  - "Mas n\xE3o para Azaus."
  - Ele sempre soube que o inferno nunca descansa.
  - "e quanto maior o sil\xEAncio, maior a tempestade que o segue."
  - "Sua busca o levou a um antigo cemit\xE9rio "
  - "onde algo inimagin\xE1vel o aguardava."
  spanishSubtitles:
  - Lentamente...
  - Lentamente emergen.
  - "Atravesando peque\xF1as fisuras en el tejido de la realidad."
  - Escapados del infierno.
  - "En peque\xF1as cantidades, son responsables de la malevolencia humana."
  - Sin embargo
  - "Cuando salen en gran n\xFAmero"
  - Amenazan la estabilidad de toda la vida en la Tierra.
  - Cuando esto sucede, se convocan a los exorcistas sagrados.
  - Criaturas antiguas que protegen a la humanidad de los demonios
  - "y son los \xFAnicos capaces de detener las fuerzas del infierno."
  - "Un largo per\xEDodo de paz hizo que los demonios fueran solo un recuerdo."
  - "Y despu\xE9s de eras"
  - "el recuerdo se convirti\xF3 en leyenda."
  - y el miedo que los humanos alguna vez sintieron por los demonios fue olvidado.
  - "La paz hizo que su existencia careciera de prop\xF3sito, y muchos se marchitaron."
  - "La llama de la vida se extingui\xF3 dentro de ellos."
  - Pero no para Azaus.
  - "\xC9l siempre supo que el infierno nunca descansa."
  - "y cuanto m\xE1s grande es el silencio, m\xE1s grande es la tormenta que lo sigue."
  - "Su b\xFAsqueda lo llev\xF3 a un antiguo cementerio"
  - donde algo inimaginable lo esperaba.
  chineseSubtitles:
  - "\u7F13\u6162\u5730..."
  - "\u7F13\u6162\u5730\u5B83\u4EEC\u6D6E\u73B0."
  - "\u4ECE\u73B0\u5B9E\u7684\u7F1D\u9699\u4E2D\u51FA\u73B0"
  - "\u4ECE\u5730\u72F1\u9003\u79BB"
  - "\u5F53\u5B83\u4EEC\u4E0D\u591A\u65F6\uFF0C\u5B83\u4EEC\u8BA9\u67D0\u4E9B\u4EBA\u5F00\u59CB\u4F5C\u6076"
  - "\u7136\u800C\uFF0C"
  - "\u5F53\u5B83\u4EEC\u5927\u91CF\u6D8C\u73B0\u65F6"
  - "\u5B83\u4EEC\u5A01\u80C1\u5730\u7403\u4E0A\u6240\u6709\u751F\u547D\u7684\u7A33\u5B9A"
  - "\u5F53\u8FD9\u53D1\u751F\u65F6\uFF0C\u5C31\u4F1A\u53EC\u5524\u795E\u5723\u7684\u6076\u9B54\u730E\u4EBA"
  - "\u4ED6\u4EEC\u4FDD\u62A4\u4EBA\u7C7B\u514D\u53D7\u6076\u9B54\u7684\u4FB5\u5BB3"
  - "\u5E76\u4E14\u662F\u552F\u4E00\u80FD\u591F\u963B\u6B62\u5730\u72F1\u529B\u91CF\u7684\u5B58\u5728"
  - "\u957F\u65F6\u95F4\u7684\u548C\u5E73\u4F7F\u6076\u9B54\u4EC5\u4EC5\u5B58\u5728\u4E8E\u8BB0\u5FC6"
  - "\u6570\u4E2A\u4E16\u7EAA\u8FC7\u53BB"
  - "\u8BB0\u5FC6\u53D8\u6210\u4E86\u4F20\u8BF4"
  - "\u4EBA\u7C7B\u9057\u5FD8\u4E86\uFF0C\u9762\u5BF9\u6076\u9B54\u7684\u6050\u60E7"
  - "\u548C\u5E73\u4F7F\u6076\u9B54\u730E\u4EBA\u7684\u5B58\u5728\u6BEB\u65E0\u610F\u4E49\uFF0C\u8BB8\u591A\u90FD\u79BB\u53BB\u4E86"
  - "\u5B83\u4EEC\u7684\u751F\u547D\u4E4B\u706B\u7184\u706D\u4E86"
  - "\u4F46\u4E0D\u5305\u62EC\u963F\u624E\u65AF"
  - "\u4ED6\u59CB\u7EC8\u77E5\u9053\uFF0C\u5730\u72F1\u6C38\u4E0D\u505C\u606F"
  - "\u6C89\u9ED8\u8D8A\u5927\uFF0C\u5176\u540E\u98CE\u66B4\u5C31\u8D8A\u5927"
  - "\u4ED6\u7684\u547D\u8FD0\uFF0C\u628A\u4ED6\u5E26\u5230\u4E00\u4E2A\u53E4\u8001\u7684\u5893\u5730"
  - "\u90A3\u91CC\u7B49\u5F85\u7740\u4ED6\u4E00\u4E9B\u96BE\u4EE5\u60F3\u8C61\u7684\u4E1C\u897F"
